WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.950
Begin with a single sheet. Notice its edges.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.950
Give the shape a moment before you move.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.950
Square the sheet. Find the centre crease.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.950
Align the two outside edges before folding.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.950
Lift the left panel toward the centre.

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.950
Bring it across. Let the edges meet.

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.950
Press along the crease, from top to bottom.

8
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
One quiet action. Watch it, then try again.
